{"id":"155158","t":{"th":"โมบิลสูทกันดั้ม แม่มดจากดาวพุธ ซีซัน 2","ro":"Kidou Senshi Gundam: Suisei no Majo Season 2","en":"Mobile Suit Gundam: The Witch from Mercury Season 2","na":"機動戦士ガンダム 水星の魔女 Season2"},"cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx155158-4MO3TP5plLSm.jpg","coverM":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx155158-4MO3TP5plLSm.jpg","color":"#5d93d6","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/155158-6iox6U8TO4BQ.jpg","fmt":"TV","status":"FINISHED","eps":12,"dur":24,"season":"SPRING","year":2023,"start":"2023-04-09","country":"JP","genres":["Action","Drama","Mecha","Sci-Fi"],"score":78,"pop":44703,"studio":"Sunrise","desc":"A.S.122...\n\nAn era when a multitude of corporations have entered space and built a huge economic system. After transferring to the Asticassia School of Technology from the planet Mercury, Suletta Mercury has experienced a school life filled with encounters and excitement, as both Miorine Rembran's bridegroom and a member of GUND-ARM, Inc.\n\nIt has been two weeks since the incident at Plant Quetta. Suletta passes her days at the school, anticipating her reunion with Miorine. Miorine, meanwhile, has stationed herself at the head office of the Benerit Group, monitoring her father's condition. The two are about to face new hardships and pressing decisions. Each with her own feelings in her heart, the girls will confront the mighty curse the Gundam brings.","descTh":"อ.ส.122...\n\nยุคที่บริษัทจำนวนมากเข้าสู่อวกาศและสร้างระบบเศรษฐกิจขนาดใหญ่ หลังจากย้ายจากดาวพุธไปเรียนที่ Asticassia School of Technology แล้ว Suletta Mercury ก็ได้พบกับชีวิตในโรงเรียนที่เต็มไปด้วยประสบการณ์และความตื่นเต้น ในฐานะเจ้าบ่าวของ Miorine Rembran และสมาชิกของ GUND-ARM, Inc.\n\nผ่านไปสองสัปดาห์แล้วนับตั้งแต่เหตุการณ์ที่แพลนท์เควตตา ซูเลตตาใช้ชีวิตอยู่ที่โรงเรียนโดยคาดหวังว่าเธอจะกลับมาพบกับมิโอรีนอีกครั้ง ขณะเดียวกัน มิโอรีนก็ประจำการอยู่ที่สำนักงานใหญ่ของกลุ่มเบเนอริต เพื่อติดตามอาการของพ่อของเธอ ทั้งสองกำลังจะเผชิญกับความยากลำบากใหม่และการตัดสินใจที่เร่งด่วน สาวๆ แต่ละคนจะต้องเผชิญหน้ากับคำสาปอันทรงพลังที่กันดั้มนำมาด้วยความรู้สึกของตัวเองอยู่ในใจ","src":{"meta":"anilist","th":"licensor","descTh":"gtranslate"},"trailer":"bQjXXzdEnMw","al":"https://anilist.co/anime/155158","mal":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/53199","jp":null,"sched":[],"prov":[{"p":"anione_th","r":"TH","u":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL_YV8EWtbQXGvBsVqmei-qNBn8F_NLHqp","lang":"sub","eps":[["1","y:i8LwkFu4__w",1698745233,"~",null,"13",{"d":1457,"sk":[[274.0,363.1],[1272.1,1447.3]]}],["2","y:xQoPhrDVQT8",1698745233,"~",null,"14",{"d":1458,"sk":[[148.8,220.0],[1342.6,1447.1]]}],["3","y:p5h6Q0_ke8Q",1698745233,"~",null,"15",{"d":1457,"sk":[[100.0,172.0],[1215.0,1302.0]]}],["4","y:aEaQNIHIoAo",1698745233,"~",null,"16",{"d":1458,"sk":[[129.0,218.0],[1342.0,1447.3]]}],["5","y:eO7AsYPom_o",1698745233,"~",null,"17",{"d":1458,"sk":[[53.0,142.0],[1342.0,1447.3]]}],["6","y:EMlWgX4gKHs",1698745233,"~",null,"18",{"d":1458,"sk":[[93.0,182.0],[1342.0,1447.3]]}],["7","y:wKV2up44XTk",1698745233,"~",null,"19",{"d":1443,"sk":[[91.0,180.0],[1332.0,1432.4]]}],["8","y:6QGKwCEJD8M",1698745233,"~",null,"20",{"d":1443,"sk":[[100.8,172.0],[1332.5,1432.4]]}],["9","y:jo-PAt7TYYY",1698745233,"~",null,"21",{"d":1443,"sk":[[89.0,161.0],[1331.0,1432.1]]}],["10","y:cRDLX9O61p4",1698745233,"~",null,"22",{"d":1443,"sk":[[125.0,197.0],[1331.0,1432.1]]}],["11","y:8KvscpmW3XY",1698745233,"~",null,"23",{"d":1443,"sk":[[189.8,261.0],[1332.6,1432.1]]}],["12","y:n32GAFZ1qyI",1698745233,"~",null,"24",{"d":1432,"sk":[[57.0,146.0]],"fin":1}]],"pat":"ทุกวันอาทิตย์ 16:00 น."},{"p":"crunchyroll","r":"TH","u":"https://www.crunchyroll.com/th/series/G79H2307W","lang":"sub","eps":[["12","https://www.crunchyroll.com/th/watch/GX9UQZ497/may-all-blessings-find-their-way-to-you-im-wishing-it",1688349600,"x","c:600x338/catalog/crunchyroll/0bdb371faa4324133ba58194da23e023.png","24",{"d":1432,"a":"premium","fin":1}],["11","ht